Performance Notice:
This software is optimized for specific hardware configurations. Best performance
is achieved on systems with:
- Windows 10/11 (build 26100 or higher)
- 8+ CPU cores (12 threads recommended)
- 8GB+ RAM
- WebGL 2.0 compatible GPU

For questions regarding optimization, contact: srushtiraj.patil20@vit.edu

Original implementation by S.R.P (2024)
Engine codename: RevOcelot
